### Important execution boundaries

The four agents must have controlled permissions.

- Planner can create and update plans.
- Designer can create design specifications.
- Builder can change approved files within its authorized workspace.
- Tester can execute approved tests and report results.
- No agent can silently change account permissions, expose secrets, deploy production code, delete important data, or perform other high-impact actions without required approval.

If the AI provider is unavailable, the platform should still function. Display an honest service-unavailable state rather than generating fake agent responses.

